# Hosts lint:link-checker cannot reach from the CI runners, not dead links.
#
# The job runs on the `docker` runner pool, which is IPv6-only. The hosts
# below either publish no AAAA record (github.com, developercertificate.org,
# www.crowdsec.net behind Vercel) or did not answer over IPv6 in any run
# (php.net, which redirects into a loop to www.php.net there). Every
# lint:link-checker run of this repository from 2026-10-13 to 2026-10-16
# timed out on exactly these, so they say something about the runner, not
# about the links. Remove an entry once the job can reach the host.
#
# One regular expression per line, matched against the URL.
^https://github\.com/
^https://developercertificate\.org/
^https://php\.net/
